    images3: {fileID: 1266073149821197568, guid: 44de97b6e5672d44aa28439ff678cc8e, type: 3}
  - lines2: (ponder..)
    names2: Pascal
    images2: {fileID: -3223278514673013308, guid: 1bd50750c44e1804b8ab3ce7aeabcf6a, type: 3}
    images3: {fileID: 1266073149821197568, guid: 44de97b6e5672d44aa28439ff678cc8e, type: 3}
  - lines2: Are the rumors really true? People disappearing? Soldiers gone terminator?
    names2: Pascal
    images2: {fileID: -3223278514673013308, guid: 1bd50750c44e1804b8ab3ce7aeabcf6a, type: 3}
    images3: {fileID: 1266073149821197568, guid: 44de97b6e5672d44aa28439ff678cc8e, type: 3}
  - lines2: ...
    names2: 
    images2: {fileID: -3223278514673013308, guid: 1bd50750c44e1804b8ab3ce7aeabcf6a, type: 3}
    images3: {fileID: 1266073149821197568, guid: 44de97b6e5672d44aa28439ff678cc8e, type: 3}
  - lines2: tsk ...
    names2: Pascal
    images2: {fileID: -3223278514673013308, guid: 1bd50750c44e1804b8ab3ce7aeabcf6a, type: 3}
    images3: {fileID: 1266073149821197568, guid: 44de97b6e5672d44aa28439ff678cc8e, type: 3}
  - lines2: "There\u2019s no use standing around. The owner of this house seems to
      be onto something."
    names2: Pascal
    images2: {fileID: -3223278514673013308, guid: 1bd50750c44e1804b8ab3ce7aeabcf6a, type: 3}
    images3: {fileID: 1266073149821197568, guid: 44de97b6e5672d44aa28439ff678cc8e, type: 3}
  - lines2: If not now, when again will the truth be unraveled?
    names2: Pascal
    images2: {fileID: -3223278514673013308, guid: 1bd50750c44e1804b8ab3ce7aeabcf6a, type: 3}
    images3: {fileID: 1266073149821197568, guid: 44de97b6e5672d44aa28439ff678cc8e, type: 3}
  - lines2: Looking back at the blood splat from earlier, I hope to find the journalist
      in time.
    names2: Pascal
    images2: {fileID: -3223278514673013308, guid: 1bd50750c44e1804b8ab3ce7aeabcf6a, type: 3}
    images3: {fileID: 1266073149821197568, guid: 44de97b6e5672d44aa28439ff678cc8e, type: 3}
  - lines2: There's no time to waste. I better make haste.
    names2: Pascal
    images2: {fileID: -3223278514673013308, guid: 1bd50750c44e1804b8ab3ce7aeabcf6a, type: 3}
    images3: {fileID: 1266073149821197568, guid: 44de97b6e5672d44aa28439ff678cc8e, type: 3}
